/**
 * AI-CONTEXT:
 *
 * Purpose:
 * - Prevents sensitive files and build artifacts from entering version control.
 *
 * Scope:
 * - IDE, Build, OS, and Infrastructure secrets.
 *
 * Critical Dependencies:
 * - Protects OCI Terraform credentials.
 *
 * Security Constraints:
 * - Strict block on `.pem`, `.tfvars`, and `.tfstate`.
 *
 * IMMUTABLE CHANGE HISTORY (DO NOT DELETE):
 * - EDITED:
 * • Added terraform and OCI specific ignores.
 * • To enforce Zero-Trust secrets management.
 * • Phase 1 Execution.
 */

# Compiled class file
*.class

# Log file
*.log

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Mobile Tools for Java (J2ME)
.mtj.tmp/

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*

# IDE specific files
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# Build directories
target/
!pom.xml

# Environment Variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.dev.example

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Authentication / Keys
auth_trigger.txt
verification_test.txt

# Infrastructure / OCI Security
oci_api_key.pem
terraform/terraform.tfvars
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.backup